  "final_text": "## Christmas Gift Guide for Bloggers & Hardware Hobbyists\n\n| Gift | Listed price | Great for |\n|---|---:|---|\n| [Flannel Shirt](https://mercantile.wordpress.org/product/blue-wordpress-flannel-button-down/) | ₩64,700 KRW | A blogger who wants an “unofficial uniform, made official” for coworking days or WordPress meetups. |\n| [CTRL Task Pad](https://mercantile.wordpress.org/product/wordpress-ctrl-task-pad/) | ₩16,200 KRW | A writer planning posts and editorial tasks on paper—“for the things a keyboard can’t fix.” |\n| [Officiel Raspberry Pi 500+ Desktop Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/raspberry-pi-500-plus-kit/) | 2.499,00 kr. DKK | A blogger or maker setting up a new computer; the kit includes the essentials needed to get started. |\n| [Waveshare CM5 PoE Mini-Computer Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/waveshare-cm5-poe-mini-computer-kit/) | 399,00 kr. DKK | A hardware hobbyist evaluating Raspberry Pi Compute Module 5 or prototyping a PoE-powered mini-computer for integration into a finished product. |\n| [Compute Blade Starter Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/compute-blade-starter-kit/) | 2.999,00 kr. DKK | An advanced hobbyist building a small cluster: the set includes four Compute Blades and practical accessories to get started. |",
